abstract: >-
  Reinstate is a local-first, vendor-neutral sync layer for AI coding agent
  sessions, MCP configs, skills, and settings across devices. It supports
  Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI, OpenCode, Grok Build, and more — with
  end-to-end encryption and bring-your-own storage.
